window.products.push({"id":705037,"name":"LONDON TAILOR Neoprene 2 Bottle Wine Carrier - Insulated Neoprene Wine Tote Purse for 2 Standard Sized Bottles - Well Built BYOB Tote - Better Quality","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDV9Ww14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Headed to a restaurant with a BYOB policy or off to a dinner party, tailgating party or picnic that calls for two bottles of fine wine? If you want to ensure that the bottles arrive safely and stay at the best temperature for sipping, you can't afford to just carry them on their own or inside of an ordinary bag. The LONDON TAILOR Neoprene 2 Bottle Wine Carrier is the absolute best way to carry wine and will have you BYOB-ing in style! The LONDON TAILOR Neoprene 2 Bottle Wine Carrier is a handy wine tote that measures 15 inches by 7 inches by 3 inches in size to fit two standard 750ml wine bottles. A strong handle lets you easily carry the wine purse carrier anywhere, and our wine purse tote is as fashionable as it is functional to suit your sense of style. Unlike other wine carriers and totes made out of ordinary cloth or bulky plastic, the LONDON TAILOR Neoprene 2 Bottle Wine Carrier is constructed out of neoprene. Just like a neoprene wetsuit, our BYOB wine tote is an incredible insulator. When you pack white and blush wines in the wine carrier purse, they'll stay colder for longer. Plus, you won't end up with a wet wine carrier tote because the neoprene keeps condensation inside. Thick and amply padded, the LONDON TAILOR Neoprene 2 Bottle Wine Carrier helps to keep bottles from breaking on the go, making it the best wine purse tote for protecting any type of wine. We're so confident in the quality of our wine bottle carrier that we offer a 30-day money-back guarantee on each one sold. Keep your wine safe and perfectly chilled while on the go with the most well built wine tote on Amazon! Order the LONDON TAILOR Neoprene 2 Bottle Wine Carrier now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mDV9Ww14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"London Tailor","source_asin":"B01CPQA9L6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CPQA9L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CPQA9L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
