window.products.push({"id":705078,"name":"QI HANG Citrus Juicer Lemon Squeezer, Manual Hand Orange Fruit Press for Orange, Lemon, Citrus, Grape Juice(Nordic Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UkALYYIyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Multiple Uses of Fruit Juice Squeezed by Lemon JuicerJuicing: Enjoy a glass of juice; enjoy a healthy life.Cooking: Add a little juice to improve the taste of food.Making a Cocktail: Use juice to make a colorful and sweet cocktail.Manual Juicers Advantages:- Made of food grade PP (polypropylene), BPA free- Perfect size for squeezing lemons, limes, oranges and other fruits with a minimum of time and effort- Perfect size holes to allow all of the juice to be extracted yet none of the seeds or heavy pulp will pass through- Original flavor reserved with this hand juicer- Easy to clean and store, easy to carryManual Citrus Juicer Specifications: Material: Premium BPA - free food grade PPColor: Dark blue/YellowTotal height: 6.2 inchContainer Diameter: 3.3 inchWeight: 0.13KG / 0.28LBHow to Use - for Citrus Fruits: Oranges, Lemons, Limes, etc.Step 1Remove the cone without filter hole from the lemon squeezer container. Put the white cone with filter hole on the lemon squeezer container. Align the 4 slots so that they do not slide.Step 2Cut citrus fruits in half. Fix the half on the white cone.Step 3Put the lid on the half fruit. Use the lid to squeeze the half fruit while rotating it. Repeat the above steps until you get enough juice.How to Use - for Other Fruits: Grape, Pomegranate, etc.Step 1Remove the cone without filter hole from the lemon squeezer container. Put the white cone with filter hole on the lemon squeezer container.Step 2Cut or divide fruits into pieces. Put the pieces into the white cone with filter hole.Step 3Use the cone without filter hole to squeeze the half fruit while rotating it. Repeat the above steps until you get enough juice. For some citrus fruits with short diameter such as lemons, a cruciform cut will enlarge diameter of the fruit to help you to fully squeeze the fruit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UkALYYIyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QI HANG","source_asin":"B0B1DFLHTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DFLHTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DFLHTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
