window.products.push({"id":705096,"name":"Leadtimes Townhouse Extra Long Curtains Linen Textured Blackout Light Blocking Grommet Window Drapes, Off White, 84 x 84 inch x 1 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HTm96kq1L._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"Polyester & Polyester Blend Imported 📌WELL PERFORMANCE - Metoer linen fabric can block out 75%-85% of sunlight and 99% UV rays. 📌HIGH QUALITY - all curtains are hand-sewn, and each set of curtains will be shipped after strict quality inspection. 📌MEASURING - 1.5-1.8x times wider than the rod or pole suggested, so that cover the whole window. 📌GROMMET TOP - silver plastic grommets, there are also other 8 colors for you to choose, please contact us in advance. 📌EASY CARE - Machine washable. Tumble dry low. Wrinkles will be disappeared after hanging for a few weeks, or iron at low setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HTm96kq1L._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leadtimes","source_asin":"B08Z6ZVF6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z6ZVF6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z6ZVF6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":705097,"name":"IYUEGO Wide Curtains 120Inch-300Inch for Large Windows Classic Double Pleated Blackout Curtains Drapes with Trim and Multi Size Custom 120\" W x 84\" L ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EZPSVAFwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"TOP CONSTRUCTION GUIDE: For Grommet, the inside diameter of Grommet is 1.6\", around 6-8 grommets in a 40 inches wide curtain. The grommet ring is nickel in silver. For Tab top, the height of tab is 4\" (10cm). There are about 6-8 tabs in a 40 inch wide curtain.For Rod Pocket, come with 2\" header, and the height of pocket is 3\" (8cm) to ensure the rod could pass through.For the Double Pleated, there are around 6-8 pleats AND firm plastic hooks in a 40 inches wide curtain. Come with firm plastic hooks.If say the width is 84 inches in the size list, for double pleated, that means the panel width at the top with 6-8 pleats already set in the panel. MEASUREMENT INSTRUCTION: For grommet and tab top curtain, measure the drop from the top of pole to where you want curtain to finish.For Pleated top construction, measure the distance from the eye where the curtain hooks attched to where you want your curtan to finish.For rod pocket, measure the distance from the top of pole to where you want curtain to finish. Curtain Width: We suggest You choose a curtain width 2 times wider than the width of the pole or tacck to create folds. For example, if the pole or track is 42 inches, then select a curtain width of 84 inches or 2 panels 42 inches each. Top Construction: Double Pleated Top Features: Blackout Color: As Per Picture Fabric Type: Polyester Crafts: Solid Fabric Weight: 250 gram/square meter ( Heavy) Includes: 1 Panel Care Instruction: Machine Wash, Do not Bleach, Warm Iron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EZPSVAFwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IYUEGO","source_asin":"B011OR1WIG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011OR1WIG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011OR1WIG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":705098,"name":"DreamBuilt Wedding Aisle Decorations for Wedding Ceremony Set of 10 Pew Flowers for Church Chair Decorations Party Decor with Artificial Flowers Eucal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lazVwEU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wedding Aisle Chair Flowers: DreamBuilt wedding aisle decoration flowers are composed of open big dark blue / dusty blue / white roses flowers, gold leaves, roses leaves, green eucalyptus leaves; the folded chiffon fabric drapes length is 1.5yards, and the silk-like ribbons are dusty blue and white; extra one 70cm ribbon attached for easy tying. These chair flowers are full in shape, rich in layers and vivid in color. The smooth lines outline the simple and atmospheric shape, elegant and fashionable style. Budget Friendly Design: Set of 10pcs Pre-Made Wedding Aisle Decoration Pew Flowers, soft handmade chiffon ribbons are also included. Great value for the money. Easy to Use: It is easy and convenient to use the 70cm long ribbon to tie the pew flowers around any size or type of chairs needed. You can also scan the barcode in the parcel to get a video for help. Easy to put on, save lots of time Details: The chair flowers size of approx 5.5\"X13\" are perfect for wedding aisle decoration, easy to add these on each chair along your wedding aisle. The chair flowers are also great for outdoor wedding and reception chair decoration. They look amazing hanging from the chairs and up the staircase. Tips: These pew decoration flowers are all artificial, never wilt. They look not only beautiful but very lifelike. You can order these aisle flowers months in advance. The flowers might bend a bit due to shipping and packing, please softly knead the petals to help recover the shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lazVwEU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DreamBuilt","source_asin":"B0B2P34485","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2P34485","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2P34485","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
