window.products.push({"id":705254,"name":"Urban Shelf -Blue- Bedside Table & Organizer, Folding Night Stand, Compact and Convenient Bed Shelf, Works Great in Dorm Rooms and on Bunk Beds! Easy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4109S-oZD0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Color:Blue  URBAN SHELF, a handy storage device designed to hold your essentials on a stable yet easily foldable platform - all smartly held in place w/ a mattress or sofa. Creates the perfect spot for keeping phones, remotes, keys, small H20 bottle, eyeglasses, books & more while in bed. Integrated cord holders ensure gadgets are charged when you wake - and eliminate the need to reach on the ground for charger tips. An edge lip keeps items like pocket change/lip balm/mints from falling. The ability to fold quickly adds portability as a key asset. Fits in any bag - which makes it great for travel. Whether at home, hotel, dorm, or anywhere else - so long as you have 7\" of clearance, Urban Shelf will fit on your side of the bed. Use it for holding chips & dip while watching TV, it easily attaches to any couch. Also doubles as a very sturdy iPad, Kindle, Nook, or tablet stand. Viewing angle is perfect for tables/ counters/airplane trays. Case or not - in portrait or landscape, Urban Shelf is a must have accessory if you watch video or read on your iPad/tablet. Designed/Made in PA, USA. DISCLAIMER: Urban Shelf will NOT hold your laptop, cat, or A-Z encyclopedia. RECENT CUSTOMER REVIEWS: Husband needed something to hold his phone and charger. This works great and we haven't had any issues Adrienne1-22-13 Perfect bedside table for a small room. Fits a phone & other stuff you need after crawling into bed. It's sturdy too, my son's Bassett hound stands on it while waiting to be put down. R. Ritter1-18-13 works well, even on a waterbed! dnsstaat1-9-13 I use this to put my remote & cell phone on it. Bob12-18-12 Product is great! vinyrdgrl12-31-12 Great! kelcanoe12-21-12 Love Urban Shelf, just what I wanted. Thanks. hartsell04 10-30-12 This thing is pretty awesome nrnunez714 10-26-12 My college-age son & daughter love it! Exactly as described mgp.kids9-28-12","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4109S-oZD0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Shelf","source_asin":"B00A1CAI5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A1CAI5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A1CAI5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":705255,"name":"RUGPADUSA, Ultra Black, 3'x5', 1/3\" Thick, Felt + Rubber, Non-Slip Cushion Rug Pad, Available in 3 Thicknesses, Safe for Hardwood and All Surfaces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1GXKAm+g8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra black 1/3 inch rug pads provide the ultimate support system for your oriental, Persian, or area rug. Ultra black 1/3 inch is a 100% felt and rubber rug pad designed for keeping rugs anchored to the floor while providing comfort and cushioning under your rugs. We offer a signature Jet black natural rubber backing, which combines a full 10oz/sq. yd. Of rubber with a reinforced 5oz/sq. Yard rubber face to prevent fraying, flaking, and premature wear. Our signature Jet black backing is combined with a 1/3'' (27 ounce) layer of felt to help support and cushion your area rugs. This dense fiber core helps prolong the life of your area rugs by reducing wear and tear from daily use. This added layer of felt protection also provides insulation, noise reduction, and acoustical benefits. Ultra black 1/4 inch works well with all types of rugs, but especially with thinner flat woven rugs such as kilim, durries, and sumac rugs. Ultra black 1/3 inch is manufactured with 100% felt & rubber and contains no glues or adhesives that can outgas, offering a more natural & rug pad alternative to traditional plastic, vinyl, and PVC rug pads. Our felt is heat pressed to the rubber, not glued, for added durability. As the cost of rubber increases, Manufacturers have been using more \"classy fillers\" In their rug pads to reduce costs. The more classy fillers are used, the faster the rubber backing will fall apart and crumble. The alternative to most felt and rubber rug pads is traditional open weave PVC padding. While more cost effective, these overseas pads can often outgas and may contain potentially toxic chemicals and plasticizers such as phthalates and formaldehyde. Both bad for the environment and bad for your floors, out-gassing from inferior padding can react with certain floor finishes to leave them permanently stained and discolored. Ultra black 1/3 inch is manufactured in the USA using only 100% felt and rubber materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1GXKAm+g8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUGPADUSA","source_asin":"B01HFH6AKE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HFH6AKE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HFH6AKE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
