window.products.push({"id":705315,"name":"Ice mold with Lids Ice Ball Mold Maker Silicone Ice Cube Tray 20 MINI Cavities molds for Juice, Cocktail and Whiskey, DIY Mold for candy, jelly, puddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510fU7JCU+L._AC_.jpg","description":"It’s summer time!How about try the homemade cute mini ice ball or ice cubes? Different tastes, different colors, slowly melt in your beverage icy stimulate your palate. Mini ice cubes, perfect match with your milk, coffee, ice cream, jelly, it is exquisite and delicious, you can share your home-make drinks for your friends and have a good time! Jelly, candy, pudding, even chocolate, you can home make a variety of snacks for kids or do this with them and create an unforgetable memories together. Feature/Benefit:: ● Each round hole diameter of about 1 cm, Each cube hole length of about 1.6cm ● Make you fully enjoy the unique taste of various kinds of soft drinks ● Dishwasher Safe, easy to clean, smooth, folding, not greasy ,non-stick, non-toxic  ● Lightweight, soft . Easy to store ● White silicone cover, dust proof, keep your mold clean ● resist temperatures from -40°F (-40°C) to 4 25°F (220°C). can be used in microwave, oven, refrigerator Package Included: -1* mini Silicone 20 cavities Ice Balls tray -1* mini Silicone 20 cavities Ice cubes tray -2* White silicone dust-proof cover ※ Note 1) Before use: please clean and then disinfect in boiling water. 2) After use: please clean and deposit in the place far away from direct sunlight and dust. 3) To avoid dust, please do not put in the air for a long time  4) Do not pull and impact or scratch it with sharp things, do not flame or direct heat, do not use abrasive soaps or scouring pad to clean Click the Button at the Top of This Page To Start Making Mini Perfect Ice molds for Your Families Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510fU7JCU+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SENY","source_asin":"B071XV7BYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071XV7BYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071XV7BYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":705316,"name":"GenericABCDEFG Enchanted Talavera Mexican Ceramic Shot Glass & Salt Shaker Hand Painted Set for Home, Bar Glasses, Decor, Alcohol Serving Gift Set (Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wuS28XfAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get the party started with Enchanted Talavera's Tequila Shot Glass Set! Comes with two beautiful shot glasses with matching salt shaker and small platter, all handmade and hand painted ceramic. The quaint little shaker and tray are the perfect accessories to fully enjoy your favorite tequila or other liquor, but even look visually striking on display on any tabletop when not being used. Great to use yourself, with friends or with family, this set has almost everything you need to kick back and unwind; you're just missing the limes! Handmade in Mexico by Talavera artisans, each piece is painstakingly painted with love. Made of high quality, substantial weight ceramic to prevent the bowl from tipping. High quality LEAD-FREE ceramic makes it safe for your family and your food!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wuS28XfAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jayde N' Grey","source_asin":"B0892SRWS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892SRWS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892SRWS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
