window.products.push({"id":705319,"name":"Maizie's Emporium | Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set | Battery Operated Automatic One Handed Salt Pepper Mill | Ceramic Grinders with Lights | Adj","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+I23oTZwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Battery Operated - This set use a total of 8 AA batteries (4 AA batteries Each)(Not Included) Automatic Salt and Pepper Grinders are noted as kitchen gadgets best sellers 2022. Simple One Hand Use Design – Perfect for those with arthritis or chronic pain. With this simple one button push design, you can easily season your dishes at the touch of a button. 2-Pack of Automatic Salt & Pepper Grinders – Get rid of your old salt and pepper shakers and add flavor with convenience to your culinary experience. Fresh ground spices will deliver enhanced flavors to your food. You can use these mills for a variety of spices:  Course sea salt White peppercorns Black peppercorns Dehydrated garlic Cumin seeds and more  Please note the following: Avoid nuts and seeds that have moisture as it can clog the ceramic grinder. Use Fresh whole spices to avoid damage to the ceramic grinder as spices do harden with age. If you see that the grinder is slowing down, gently shake the grinder to loosen any hard spices within the grinder.   Funnel included to make it easy when refilling the Spice Mills. Clear glass container seen when refill is needed. Adjustable Coarseness – With our high quality Ceramic Grinder, it is easy to change the coarseness of the spices simply by twisting the knob on the bottom mills to adjust the level. Minimalist Design - These Mills are made from high quality brushed stainless steel.  The LED light guides you exactly where and how much seasoning is being used, to prevent over flavoring. Caps on the bottoms to prevent dust from entering and keep your table and kitchen clean. Perfect Gift Idea - Minimal Aesthetics by Maizie’s Emporium battery operated, stainless steel salt and pepper grinder set is the best addition to anyones kitchen! The Minimal Aesthetics look and gift box making it a perfect present for Housewarming parties, Weddings, Birthdays and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+I23oTZwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BLRRJDNT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLRRJDNT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLRRJDNT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
