window.products.push({"id":705355,"name":"Qualitell Headboard Cover Stretch Bed Headboard Slipcover Protector for Bedroom Decor - Cal King, Turquoise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zu3SBWIcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥PREMIUM MATERIAL: The headboard slipcover is made from premium spandex fabric and polyester. Super soft and comfortable. Anti-wrinkle, anti-pilling, dust-proof and low shrinkage, environmentally friendly. ♥FUNCTIONAL: The stretchy and breathable material made it suits for most kinds of headboard. Attached with an elastic band, it will best wrap your headboard and stay put on your bed headboard. (Please measure the length of your headboard and choose the proper size that fits your headboard.) ♥HOME BETTER CHOICE: Save your money, Qualitell headboard cover will refresh your bedroom a new look with lower cost than to replace a new headboard. ♥PERFECT FIT: Cal King headboard cover size 71\"-83\" / 180-210 cm suits for most headboard from 71 inch to 83 inch. Please measure the length of your headboard and choose the proper size that fits your headboard. ♥EFFORTLESS CARE: Easy to install and remove, hand or machine washable with similar colors around 30 degrees Celsius. Use mild laundry detergent. Do not iron or bleach. Kindly remind that please check your headboard size before your purchase.☺Any question you could contact us directly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zu3SBWIcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUALITELL","source_asin":"B086W1GG48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086W1GG48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086W1GG48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":705356,"name":"HOTBALZER Bathroom Rug Mat, Extra Soft and Absorbent Microfiber Bath Rugs, Non-Slip Shaggy Plush Bath Carpet, Machine Wash Dry Bath Mats for Bathroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nwW8O6oTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Soft and Thick】Hotbalzer Bathroom Rug Mat is made of polyester microfiber shags and fiber-lock technique that all clusters of the fiber floss are knitted tightly, offering exceptional comfort and support for your feet. The soft plush of our bath mat soothes your tired foot and shields toes from the cold floor.Every time you step out of the shower or bathtub, you can enjoy superior comfort like sinking into a deep cotton pile. 🎁【Super Absorbent and Fast-Drying】Hotbalzer Bath Rug's fiber about 1 inch and more compact and thicker than Regular Chenille Bathroom Rugs. Dense pile soaks up water quickly as you get out of the shower or bathtub and moisture is trapped in the shower rug's deep pile, allowing the Bathroom Mat to dry quickly and cleanly. As we professionally tested, it can absorb 3 times of water in few seconds. 🎁【Non-Slip & Longer Lasting Material】The Bathroom Rug using grippy TPR rubber backing to keep the shower rugs firmly in place to protect your family's safety. The durable materials and high-quality construction of our bath rugs ensure that it will not deteriorate, flatten or fall apart with use. Color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried. WARNING: Keep the bottom of the mat dry, the rug must be placed on clean dry flat floor. 🎁【Machine Washable & Easy Care】The premium construction of Bath mats allow you to machine wash and dry. Wash on cold with mild detergent. Use only non-chlorine bleach, hang to dry or air dry flat and Do not Bleach or Dry Clean. After 10 times machine wash test, our bathroom rugs still look as good as the new one. In addition, we recommend that you wash it at least once two week. In this way, you can maintain your shower mat and more importantly, it is good for hygiene and health. 🎁【Beautiful Décor & Multi-Purpose Use】The bathroom bath mats designed simple geometry patterns and in neutral color, to provide beautiful décor to nearly any space in your bathroom. The bath room rugs work perfectly in front of your single or double sink, shower, bathtub or anywhere you want to have support and warmth for your feet. Further, our bath rugs for bathroom make a perfect gifting choice for your friends and family during Christmas, Mother’s Day, Father ’s Day or any other special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nwW8O6oTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTBALZER","source_asin":"B0C3QVWTNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3QVWTNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3QVWTNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
