window.products.push({"id":705472,"name":"EGOHOME Convertible Sofa Bed, 4 in 1 Multi-Function Floor Couch with Foldable Leg, Modern Sofa Chair with Adjustable Backrest, Mini Couch Sleeper for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uFiMFwMAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convertible Sofa Fit Various Scene: This convertible sofa can be easily turned into a floor bed or a lazy couch that can be easily adapted to meet the demands of life in your living room or guest room, or even in your bay window, or even keep your friends overnight after a party. Adjustable Backrest For 5 Gear: The fold out couch bed has a 5-gear adjustable backrest, which can be used as a couch for watching TV, playing games and reading. It can also be easily adjusted so that you can rest on it or become a lazy recliner and meditate by the window, whichever position brings you a comfortable experience Durable And Space-Saving Futon Leg: Sturdy and reliable alloy legs can hold up to 260 pounds, a height of 9 inches saves you a lot of storage space, and can be easily passed by a robot sweeper. The foldable legs turns your couch into a floor sofa Ergonomic And Modern Design: The removable and washable cover is filled with shredded memory foam for comfort when you recline or lie on the sofa bed and the wooden structure ensures enough support to keep you from sinking in. No Installation Required: The whole In-A-Box sofa bed will easy deliver to your house and setup. Just unpack it, not even install it. owning a new convertible sofa has never been so easy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uFiMFwMAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MLILY","source_asin":"B0B67KWNY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B67KWNY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B67KWNY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":705473,"name":"Culina® Pizza Cutter 14\" Stainless Steel, Wooden Handle (Beech)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31iNLEggViL._AC_.jpg","description":"Steel meet wood design. Precision cut. Multipurpose Culina Pizza Cutter cuts uniform slices in one quick rocking motion. Traditional knives pull the pizza apart, slice unevenly; roller wheel cutters tend to “smoosh” the crust, trap and drag cheese, sauce and toppings off the pizza. Avoid the frustration, get Culina rocking cutter: its heavy duty design (3\" large at the curve) adds a touch of rugged yet stylish appeal to your kitchen décor all the while boasting a performance to rip through a deep dish pizza crust. Not just pizzas: cut soap bars or sandwiches, chop herbs, produce, meat or mince garlic and nuts! Scoop ingredients up thanks to the large blade surface. Heavy duty, stainless steel construction. Built to last Don't be fooled by the aesthetics, Culina Pizza Cutter boasts a full frame, 3\" stainless steel sheet with a thick, wooden structure at the top to form a reliable, non-slip, comfortable grip handle. Rigid enough to withstand the firm pressure, it provides heft and balance to push down effortlessly on the food. Many with arthritis have raved about its extreme ease of use. The sturdy, ultra sharp tapered blade ensures a clean, uniform cut with full efficiency every time. Its size spans the length of the pizza and only requires a no-strain, easy rock movement to get the slicing done! Mess-free! Engineered for heavy duty use, it won’t bend, warp or dull easily on you. A tough-built for longevity and great value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31iNLEggViL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B00MI7TN60","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MI7TN60","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MI7TN60","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
