window.products.push({"id":705537,"name":"DakshCraft ® Handmade Pure Copper Hammered Moscow Mule Mug,Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BiMqqt8QL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description : DakshCraft Copper drink-ware is one of the hottest trends right now. The shiny metal tumblers, mugs, and pitchers have been steadily showing up on store shelves and at bars across the world. The copper mugs and tumblers resurgence is due in part to the renewed popularity of a cocktail that was all the rage back in the 1950s called a Moscow mule. The alcoholic beverage is made up of vodka, ginger beer, and lime juice, and is traditionally served in a copper mug.However, most people unaware of the fact that copper mugs and tumblers can provide our bodies with numerous health benefits. In fact, there is a long list of all the natural and positive ways it impacts health, and you can gain them simply by drinking out of a copper cup!! How to keep your copper utensils clean:: Copper darkens naturally over a period of time. The copper mugs and tumblers oxidizes with water and requires cleaning from time to time. Use lemon juice or tamarind to rub the utensils. Leave it for few minutes and wash with water.Not dishwasher safeNot to be used in microwaveNot to use with hot beverages SUPPORT: Your questions will be answered within 24 Hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BiMqqt8QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DakshCraft","source_asin":"B00Y2A1LJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y2A1LJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y2A1LJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
