window.products.push({"id":705846,"name":"GEMLON Disposable Piping Bags and Tips Set, 100Pcs 16 Inch Plastic Frosting Bags with Tips Large Royal Icing Piping Bags, Cookies&Cupcake&Cake Decorat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619MOD0xlTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【HEALTHY MATERIAL IS SAFE FOR YOUR FAMILY】- This new package includes 100pcs 16inch disposable pastry bags, 6 stainless steel decorating tips, 2 frosting couplers, 2 piping bag ties. The disposable icing bags features dense plastic material, nontoxic and tasteless, ensuring your family is kept completely safe. Ideal and safe for use with hot or cold foods. Clear polyethylene bags for quick icing color identification. ★【EXTRA THICK - NO-BURSTING】- 0. 08 mm, thicker than mainstream plastic icing bags (only 0. 02-0. 04mm), which can withstand more powerful extrusion. This means that they can hold a lot of butter cream without splitting. With these disposable frosting bags on hand, you’re free to apply as much pressure as you want. Now, let’s say bye to the days of slaving over some weak, easy to burst piping bags! ★【LARGE CAPACITY AND WIDE OPENING】- 16 inch provides you a spacious capacity to filling that allow you constantly icing & frosting, you don’t have to refill frequently to save your time. wide opening makes bag simple to fill, Perfect for making enough treats for a whole office or classroom. Bonus 2 couplers - helps you change piping tips without unnecessarily wasting bags or frosting. Bonus 2 frosting bags ties - keep your icing work very neat and tidy. ★【EASY SQUEEZEY】- Non-slip design is easy to hold, giving you a good grip while squeezing and dispensing consistently. Plus it can be cut to suit any sized piping tips or nozzles. Just trim the end of the pastry bag to fit your decorating tip, and if use with a coupler, you can easily replace different shapes of piping tips. Your baking supplies kit won't be complete without this pro set bags! ★【100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE】- We are confident to the quality of our disposable decorating bags. We will give you full refund with no question asked if you have any unhappy purchase experience, but we are sure to say that you will love it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619MOD0xlTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEMLON","source_asin":"B0818T1F7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0818T1F7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0818T1F7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
