window.products.push({"id":705861,"name":"TWSOUL Bra Washing Bags Silicone Laundry Lingerie Bra Bag Without Zipper, Undergarments Washing Bags Laundry Ball for Bra, Protect Bra from Deformatio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AZVXrrctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👙[Safety Silicone Bra Cleaning Bag] This silicone bra cleaning bag is made of silicone, with a smooth and soft surface, high temperature and low temperature resistance, and protects the bra from deformation. Our bra bags can be in direct contact with the skin, have a long service life, are easy to store, and are ready for next use. 👙[Suitable for Most Types of Bras] With the help of Flip Design and 9 tab lock shells, even if you throw it in your hand with other clothes, the silicone washing bag will remain firm and stable. The hemispherical design of the bra laundry bag can effectively isolate the bra from the outside clothes and prevent the bra strap from tangling or loosening. It is suitable for cleaning the underwear under the D cup (including the D cup). 👙[Zipperless Design] The laundry underwear bag is different from the traditional laundry bag zipper design. The button design is used instead of the zipper to prevent the zippers, buckles, buckles, belts and lace linings of the bra from getting stuck during the washing and drying process. , Break and stretch. 👙[Excellent Water Permeability and Air Permeability] The unique honeycomb mesh structure of the underwear washing bag makes it easy for detergent and water to pass through the mesh, so that the bra can be washed and cleaned more effectively, and the best washing effect can be achieved in the washing machine. It can also be used in clothes dryers. 👙[The Perfect Companion for Ladies] Our products can not only be used as a bra cleaning bag, but also can be used to store the bra. Even in the suitcase, the bra can get excellent protection. It is a must-have product for family travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AZVXrrctL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TWSOUL","source_asin":"B08J7V15CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-705861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J7V15CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J7V15CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
